                        197</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d369-f3" n="4" xml:id="d369-f3-content">
                <p>United States delegation to the third regular session of the United Nations
                    General Assembly which convened at Paris on September 21.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
